%% WeaveNYC — User Journey: First Open to Value (within 30s)
%% Source: 02_PRD.md §4 + 03_User_Flows.md

flowchart TD
    START([User Opens App]) --> LANG[Select Language<br/>EN / ES / ZH]
    LANG --> ZIP[Enter ZIP Code<br/>or Allow Location]
    ZIP --> HOME[Home: Resource List<br/>Open Pantries / Soup Kitchens]

    HOME --> |Want mutual aid| POST[Create Post<br/>Request / Offer]
    HOME --> |Just browsing| DETAIL[Resource Detail<br/>Address / Phone / Hours]

    DETAIL --> CALL[One-Tap Call]
    DETAIL --> NAV[One-Tap Navigate]

    POST --> |Light registration| REG[Phone OTP<br/>or Email Magic Link]
    REG --> COMPOSE[Fill Out Request<br/>Category + Description + Location]
    COMPOSE --> MATCH[Receive 3 Action Plans<br/>Neighbor Match + Official Fallback]

    MATCH --> CONTACT[Start Contact<br/>Chat After Both Agree]

    style START fill:#E8F5E9,stroke:#2E7D32
    style HOME fill:#FFE0B2,stroke:#E65100
    style MATCH fill:#BBDEFB,stroke:#1565C0
    style CONTACT fill:#CE93D8,stroke:#6A1B9A
